CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION

Contract Modification:
#1
Project:

Gymnastics Facility
Project Number:

Contract # 7897
Contractor:

Richardson Construction
Date Prepared:

04-16-2024

The above referenced contract is amended or modified as set forth in the following and these
amendments and modifications of the plans and specifications are agreed to by the parties. All other
aspects of the original agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.

I. Description of Changes
Add the construction of the offsite detention pond, remove existing offsite storm pipe, and the
supply and operation of a water pump to divert storm water away from the Gymnastics grading
site and keep the project schedule on track. (This condition was created due to Paul Smith Way
not being constructed by the original developer. Please see attached Field Order #1.

II. New Contract Items
Additional MOB. Additional Survey. Remove and dispose of 36” storm pipe. Unclassified
excavation and grading detention pond.

III. Schedule

Add 5 working days.

IV. Summary

Original Contract Amount ..............................................................................$5,434,182.00
Previous Modifications ......................................................................................................$0
Contract Amount Prior to this Modification ...................................................$5,434,182.00
This Modification ................................................................................................$74,292.50
New Contract Amount ....................................................................................$5,508,474.50

V. GL Account Information

If requesting a modification to the contract price, please list GL account # to cover the balance of
this modification (if using more than (1) GL account, list the dollar amount for each respective
account):
The GL account # for this contract modification is 020-26-2616-42-43498
.
9:42 am, Apr 17 2024
