### Page 4 of 4

```text
MEMO

TO:

Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins, City of Cheyenne
Members of the City Council, City of Cheyenne

FROM:
Doug Klahn, 1% Construction Department

DATE:
April 16, 2024

SUBJECT:
Contract Modification #1 to Richardson Construction, for the Gymnastics Facility
Project.

Please find the attached proposed contract modification for the above referenced city project.
Construction, Engineering, and CRE Staff have discussed the need for the offsite detention pond
construction and removal of existing storm pipes to divert stormwater away from the project
building site. By adding this work to the contract, it allows the contractor to avoid any delays to
the project schedule. The additional costs associated with this modification are $74,292.50. The
funding for this modification is from the street renovations fund which is also funding the
construction of Paul Smith Way. Staff respectfully request your approval of this contract
modification.

.

CITY ENGINEER’S OFFICE
2101 O’Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
```
